      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be nice. When I don't want to see the hud, which is always, I would still like to be able to see my mic icon. The hud has just been annoying and in my way when I want to watch something or spend time with friends on desktop. Breaks my desktop flavored virtual immersion because I can't just get all of the hud nonsense out of my view. Compact isn't even compact, it just removes the text but makes nothing smaller. \n\nMinimal should remove the menu and mic buttons that are very easily accessible already for desktop users with one hand. I don't feel like there is a need for those to be clickable buttons as if VRC were a complex MMO or a game playable with just a mouse.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
